    "body": "Codex (m3) read this issue for work and did not claim it.\n\nThis issue cannot start on upstream/main `0957b20aa`.\n\n- The work parses posted NC output with `camcraft-gcode`.\n- `crates/gcode` is not on upstream/main. No `Cargo.toml` names `camcraft-gcode`.\n- #2217 (the crate) is open and has no PR.\n- #2219 (the Sinumerik, Heidenhain, Mazak and Doosan dialects) is open and has no PR.\n- No open PR supplies the reader, so there is no branch to stack on.\n\nThe 10 posts cannot pass a read-back test before #2217 and #2219 merge.\n\nSuggestion: set `blocked` on this issue until #2217 and #2219 merge. The maintainer decides.\n",
